venu-pacific (26.08.6) trixie; urgency=medium

  * venu-pacific-assistant: make the run-on list fix actually work. The line
    breaks added in 26.08.3 (numbered lists) and 26.08.5 (bulleted lists)
    were inserted correctly and then thrown away a moment later:
    _wrap_message_text filled whole paragraphs with textwrap.fill, which
    collapses every newline inside what it is given. Both fixes shipped and
    neither had any effect on screen. It now wraps line by line, so blank
    lines still separate paragraphs, long lines are still wrapped, and
    deliberate line breaks survive.

